      "content": "hey, im on sertraline for my anxiety and i just picked up some cough syrup with dextromethorphan cuz i have this annoying cough that wont go away. is it safe to take the syrup with my sertraline? i dont want to mess up my meds but i really need to get some sleep tonight.",
