      "content": "wait really?? i was reading some forums and everyone was saying it's totally fine as long as you dont take too much, and my friend who takes similar meds says she uses it all the time without any issues. i feel totally fine right now, so is it possible the risk is just really low? like, if i just took a tiny bit, like half a dose, would that be okay? i just really need to stop this cough so i can sleep.",
